# 20% boss damage with full orbs, added to what the character's gear and
# passives give: boss damage is the same kind of damage % wherever it comes
# from.
name: "Advanced Combo Attack - Boss Rush"
description:
  "Damage increases when attacking Boss Monster for each combo."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERO skill_order: 6 }
